   296	   1. `Cargo.toml` → `version = "…"`
   297	   2. `web/package.json` → `"version": "…"`
   298	   3. `worker/package.json` → `"version": "…"`
   299	   4. `install.sh` → `DEFAULT_VERSION="v…"`
   300	   5. `install.ps1` → `$DefaultVersion = "v…"`
